flowchart LR
    HTTP[Interface: REST routes] --> CMD[Application: Command Handlers]
    CMD --> DOM[Domain: User, Entities, Value Objects]
    CMD --> REPO[Domain: UserRepository]
    SQL[Infrastructure: SQLAlchemy adapter] -. implements .-> REPO
    CMD --> UOW[Application: UnitOfWork]
    UOW --> OUTBOX[Infrastructure: transaction and outbox]
    OUTBOX --> EVT[Application: Event Handlers]
    EVT --> PROJ[Infrastructure: projections and audit]
